5,1,1,talk,May,,"This room is a mess. Whoever grabs it first wins, and I always end up cleaning.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The noise from the door is constant. It makes focusing on my work nearly impossible.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"We must ask where our hours go. Is it the walking, or the cleaning?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I need to see the money. We are paying for space we cannot use properly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"We are right next to each other, yet we barely speak. That feels wrong.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Servas, exactly. I want to know who is actually using this space and how often.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Sakura, the invoices might show if we are overpaying for this chaos.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I will look at the usage tally. We need data, not just feelings.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I will check the invoices and the fridge clear-out. Old costs need clearing.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I want to see where the last awkward conversation happened. It matters.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"@Kenji, that sounds personal, but maybe it explains the tension. I will check the bins.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will look at the partition wall. Sound travels through thin walls.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will also check the facilities callouts. Broken things waste time.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@May, crumbs are a symptom. I will look at the lunch round trip too.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will check the unspoken talk since the refit. We need to hear it.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,Let’s get the facts. I am done guessing who is responsible for what.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"Agreed. Silence is better than shouting, but only if the room allows it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,Wisdom comes from knowing the truth. Let us find it before we decide.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Numbers don’t lie. I hope the quotes for fit-outs are reasonable.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I hope we find a way to be friends again, not just neighbors.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
