35,2,1,talk,May,,"The tally is brutal. Two people used it eleven times, the rest four. It’s not shared.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The wall is thin. I can hear every word spoken inside. It’s not a private space.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"Eleven callouts for equipment, none for the empty room. We pay for what we don’t use.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"I found the invoices. We paid 68,000 yen for outside hire. That is a lot for four people.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"I found where the last awkward conversation happened. It was right here, in the open.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Sakura, 68,000 yen? That’s why I’m tired. We are paying for a mess.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, the crumbs are everywhere. It’s not just noise, it’s the physical mess too.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"The walking is the real cost. We walk to the fridge, to the bins, to the door.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Sakura,,The fridge clear-out showed half the food was nobody’s. We waste money on waste.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,The unplanned talk since the refit is gone. We only talk by the printer now.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"So we have a room that is too loud, too messy, and too expensive.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"It is a sensory nightmare. I need to hear my own thoughts, not the room.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,We must stop the leakage of time. Every step is a step away from work.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"If we fix the wall and the bins, maybe the cost drops. I need the quotes.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"If we fix the space, maybe we can talk again. I need a place to say hard things.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,"I want a system. No more first-come, first-served. No more me cleaning up.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"I want quiet. If we can’t have that, I will work from home.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us look at the options. We have the data now. Let us choose wisely.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I will wait for the options. I want to see the total cost of each path.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I will wait too. I want a room where we can be honest with each other.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
