60,3,1,talk,May,,Option C. A shared calendar means no more guessing. No more me cleaning up after strangers.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Option B. I need silence. If we are all sitting alone, the noise stops.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option A. If we eat together, we stop walking to the fridge. It saves time and builds community.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Sakura,,Option C. The quotes for the meeting space are lower than the kitchen. It is the smart financial choice.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Kenji,,Option C. A table means we can sit together. It gives us a reason to talk.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,May,,"@Sakura, the cost is good, but the calendar is the real win. It’s fair.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, a table doesn’t stop the noise. I need to hear my own thoughts.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Misaki, the kitchen is about connection. We are not just workers, we are people.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, connection is nice, but the budget is tight. We can’t afford the kitchen.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, I hear you. But if we never talk, we stay strangers. I need to say things.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,May,,I am voting for C. It removes the ambiguity. It removes the burden from me.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I am voting for B. It removes the intrusion. It gives me back my focus.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Servas,,I am voting for A. It removes the walking. It gives us back our hours.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I am voting for C. It removes the waste. It gives us back our money.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I am voting for C. It removes the distance. It gives us back our friendship.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,May,,"Let’s do this. I want a room that works for everyone, not just the loudest.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I hope the quiet holds. I need to be able to think without interruption.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Servas,,I hope the food is good. I hope we find time to sit and talk.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Sakura,,I hope the numbers work out. I hope we don’t regret this in a month.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Kenji,,"I hope we find the words. I hope we can be friends again, not just neighbors.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
